Watch out for
1.Store the phone number as a string, not int. Phone numbers can start with 0 and you never do math on them.
2.In Update, check that the field the user types is one of phone, email, city. Otherwise address_book[name][field] = ... would quietly create a new, wrong field.


Bonus (optional)
1.In Search, let the user also search by city (show everyone living in that city).
